[x]{:fr} a span carrying a language

{:de}
a block-attribute line carrying a language

-{:fr} a bullet glued to a language attribute

1.{:fr} an ordered marker glued to a language attribute

[y]{:zh-Hant .hl} a language beside a class

[z]{:} the empty form

[w]{:toolongtag} nine characters is not a subtag
